img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339240/extras/87f93400bb951dc6b76e3585da3caf6b.avif?t=1737998600\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Card Building</strong>: Create and customize your card deck to face different life challenges, from stress at work to personal dilemmas, and find the best strategies to manage them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Life Simulation</strong>: From managing your career to nurturing relationships and taking care of your health, the game immerses you in the ups and downs of real life, testing your ability to juggle multiple aspects of personal well-being.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "A strategic life-simulation game where your choices shape your ability to adapt. Play strategy cards like Meditate to reduce stress or Self-Learn to prepare for challenges. Manage resources, tackle obstacles, and face unexpected twists. Will you rise beyond the struggle or succumb to the pressure?",
